## Why This Is Asked
Assesses ability to isolate a new heavy path (ML inference) from existing flow and design an observable test with limited risk.

## Key Concepts
- Baseline vs variant experiments
- Canary/feature flags
- Cache warming and warm vs cold runs
- Concurrency modeling and resource metrics
- Observability integration (Prometheus, Grafana)

## Code Example

```javascript
import http from 'k6/http';
import { check, sleep } from 'k6';
export let options = { vus: 8000, duration: '2m' };
export default function() {
  const res = http.get('https://api.example.com/search_ai?q=test');
  check(res, { 'status is 200': (r) => r.status === 200 });
  sleep(0.5);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you gradually increase AI traffic in production?
- How would you handle data privacy for training data during tests?

